    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Race into the Chaotic &amp; Ridiculous.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a reflection of the 1990's era super cars and the arcade video games about them. It has meticulously hand drawn tracks with pixel art vehicles to give an overall sense of vitality and beauty. Despite the objective to smash as much as you possibly can while you race overpowered sports machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Irreverent &amp; Makeshift Race Tracks.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from several tracks, with destructible environments such as: shopping centres, national geological treasure caves, farmlands, mining sites, jungle and dirt roads, multiple railway crossings, china shops, active volcanoes and even an Amazoom warehouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713790/extras/ecbcf7b629e4568d960d3d570c3c26a0.avif?t=1750160653\" width=300 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Driving your Aventora Supercar through a mini-mall with other racers.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713790/extras/0e6b025dd5dc1d7924814637c22c40ac.avif?t=1750160653\" width=300 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>An active open-pit mini site.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713790/extras/a0520fc9dbb4f22b32dd8ef8e8414256.avif?t=1750160653\" width=300 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Underground driving cutaway-view of a crystal cavern being aggressively, toured.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713790/extras/aea4dae1d6426b800d0ad078932664f5.avif?t=1750160653\" width=300 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wide dirt roads with exploding tyre walls (when struck).</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713790/extras/a4786911a4f259512d880af6260c1c73.avif?t=1750160653\" width=300 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Delivery parcel arrived late? Now you know why. Driving through a packaging warehouse was never as fun as it is now.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713790/extras/7f34eda68e3b783074427bda024d73fd.avif?t=1750160653\" width=300 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>B - R - A - K - E ! ! !</i></strong><i> Or be <strong>Slammed!</strong> That's 400 tonnes of locomotive and carriages passing through!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Hectic, Frantic, Difficult.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>3 levels of difficulty</strong>, and <strong>8 tracks <i>(New track added, Montezuma @ 17/06/2025)</i></strong> to play and unlock. Do note, Gold level will require all your nous, reflexes and ability to drive competently. Or, better yet, 'recklessly, aggressively stupid and diabolically evil'. Draw no quarter, win at any cost!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713790/extras/1eb2d5832e55ba02ecd746a44caaedbc.avif?t=1750160653\" width=300 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Levels and Expert Tracks unlock from 'Race Wins' and 'Season Calendar Positions'.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Roots.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A reference to the Game: Supercars 1 &amp; 2 on the Amiga, this could be considered a remake with more hand drawn, hand painted artwork with enhanced destructible environments and increased difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Overall.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thrillingly fast, top-down 2d racer that blends lovingly detailed scenery with wanton destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>Special Newbies Driving Note.</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The car turns on it's axis. It has no reverse gear. If you hit a wall front on, Stop (Use Brakes) and Twist on the spot.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Race into the Chaotic &amp; Ridiculous.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a reflection of the 1990's era super cars and the arcade video games about them. It has meticulously hand drawn tracks with pixel art vehicles to give an overall sense of vitality and beauty. Despite the objective to smash as much as you possibly can while you race overpowered sports machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Irreverent &amp; Makeshift Race Tracks.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from several tracks, with destructible environments such as: shopping centres, national geological treasure caves, farmlands, mining sites, jungle and dirt roads, multiple railway crossings, china shops, active volcanoes and even an Amazoom warehouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713790/extras/ecbcf7b629e4568d960d3d570c3c26a0.avif?t=1750160653\" width=300 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Driving your Aventora Supercar through a mini-mall with other racers.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713790/extras/0e6b025dd5dc1d7924814637c22c40ac.avif?t=1750160653\" width=300 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>An active open-pit mini site.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713790/extras/a0520fc9dbb4f22b32dd8ef8e8414256.avif?t=1750160653\" width=300 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Underground driving cutaway-view of a crystal cavern being aggressively, toured.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713790/extras/aea4dae1d6426b800d0ad078932664f5.avif?t=1750160653\" width=300 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wide dirt roads with exploding tyre walls (when struck).</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713790/extras/a4786911a4f259512d880af6260c1c73.avif?t=1750160653\" width=300 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Delivery parcel arrived late? Now you know why. Driving through a packaging warehouse was never as fun as it is now.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713790/extras/7f34eda68e3b783074427bda024d73fd.avif?t=1750160653\" width=300 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>B - R - A - K - E ! ! !</i></strong><i> Or be <strong>Slammed!</strong> That's 400 tonnes of locomotive and carriages passing through!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Hectic, Frantic, Difficult.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>3 levels of difficulty</strong>, and <strong>8 tracks <i>(New track added, Montezuma @ 17/06/2025)</i></strong> to play and unlock. Do note, Gold level will require all your nous, reflexes and ability to drive competently. Or, better yet, 'recklessly, aggressively stupid and diabolically evil'. Draw no quarter, win at any cost!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713790/extras/1eb2d5832e55ba02ecd746a44caaedbc.avif?t=1750160653\" width=300 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Levels and Expert Tracks unlock from 'Race Wins' and 'Season Calendar Positions'.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Roots.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A reference to the Game: Supercars 1 &amp; 2 on the Amiga, this could be considered a remake with more hand drawn, hand painted artwork with enhanced destructible environments and increased difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Overall.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thrillingly fast, top-down 2d racer that blends lovingly detailed scenery with wanton destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>Special Newbies Driving Note.</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The car turns on it's axis. It has no reverse gear. If you hit a wall front on, Stop (Use Brakes) and Twist on the spot.</i></p>",
